For Action

Due Date: 31 October 2026

The IETF V6OPS WG [1] would like to inform the 3GPP SA2/SA3 that the WG is considering adoption of work referencing 3GPP work. Specifically, the following document is candidate for adoption: Considerations of IPv6-only Deployment in 5G Mobile Networks (draft-ma-v6ops-5g-ipv6only) [2].

Whether this document is adopted by the IETF V6OPS WG will depend on the community feedback.

The V6OPS WG is interested for reviews from the 3GPP SA2/SA3 about the alignment of this specification with the 3GPP 5G specifications, in particular.

The V6OPS WG encourage the use of V6OPS WG mailing list [3] as the most effective and expedient way of exchanging information, answering questions, and progressing any work.

OPS Area Director: Mohamed Boucadair

V6OPS Chairs: Marcus Ihlar & Thomas Graf

